  - id: tekkamaki
    categoryId: maki
    nameJa: "\u9244\u706B\u5DFB\u304D"
    reading: "\u3066\u3063\u304B\u307E\u304D"
    romaji: tekkamaki
    nameVi: "Sushi cu\u1ED9n c\xE1 ng\u1EEB"
    nameEn: Tuna roll
    priceYen: 350
    descriptionJa: "\u9244\u706B\u5DFB\u304D\u306F\u307E\u3050\u308D\u306E\u307E\u304D\u305A\u3057\u3067\u3059\u3002"
    descriptionVi: "Cu\u1ED9n c\xE1 ng\u1EEB \u0111\u1ECF v\u1EDBi rong bi\u1EC3n
      b\xEAn ngo\xE0i. Theo m\u1ED9t gi\u1EA3 thuy\u1EBFt ph\u1ED5 bi\u1EBFn, 'tekka'
      (\u9244\u706B) g\u1EAFn v\u1EDBi c\xE1c s\xF2ng b\u1EA1c x\u01B0a, n\u01A1i
      ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ta c\u1EA7n m\xF3n \u0103n nhanh b\u1EB1ng m\u1ED9t tay. M\u1ED9t
      ph\u1EA7n g\u1ED3m 6 mi\u1EBFng nh\u1ECF."
    descriptionEn: A tuna roll wrapped in seaweed. One popular theory links the name
      'tekka' to old gambling dens where a one-handed snack was handy. One order
      is 6 small pieces.
    ingredientsVi:
    - "C\u01A1m sushi"
    - "C\xE1 ng\u1EEB"
    - "Rong bi\u1EC3n"
    allergensVi:
    - "C\xE1"
    - "\u0110\u1EADu n\xE0nh (n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u01B0\u01A1ng)"
    eatingTipVi: "Ch\u1EA5m nh\u1EB9 m\u1ED9t \u0111\u1EA7u mi\u1EBFng cu\u1ED9n
