  - id: futomaki
    categoryId: maki
    nameJa: "\u592A\u5DFB\u304D"
    reading: "\u3075\u3068\u307E\u304D"
    romaji: futomaki
    nameVi: "Sushi cu\u1ED9n l\u1EDBn nhi\u1EC1u nh\xE2n"
    nameEn: Thick roll with many fillings
    priceYen: 450
    descriptionJa: "\u592A\u5DFB\u304D\u306F\u5927\u304D\u3044\u307E\u304D\u305A\u3057\u3067\u3059\u3002\u3044\u308D\u3044\u308D\u306A\u3082\u306E\u304C\u5165\u3063\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3059\u3002"
    descriptionVi: "Cu\u1ED9n to v\u1EDBi nhi\u1EC1u nh\xE2n nh\u01B0 tr\u1EE9ng,
      d\u01B0a leo, n\u1EA5m shiitake v\xE0 ch\u1EA3 c\xE1, c\u1EAFt ra th\u1EA5y
      nhi\u1EC1u m\xE0u. Ng\xE0y Setsubun (3/2), ng\u01B0\u1EDDi Nh\u1EADt c\xF3
      t\u1EE5c \u0103n nguy\xEAn m\u1ED9t cu\u1ED9n 'ehomaki' (\u6075\u65B9\u5DFB)
      quay v\u1EC1 h\u01B0\u1EDBng may m\u1EAFn trong im l\u1EB7ng. M\u1ED9t ph\u1EA7n
      g\u1ED3m 4 mi\u1EBFng l\u1EDBn."
    descriptionEn: A thick roll with egg, cucumber, shiitake and fish cake. On Setsubun
      (Feb 3) many people eat a whole 'ehomaki' in silence facing the lucky direction.
      One order is 4 large pieces.
    ingredientsVi:
    - "C\u01A1m sushi"
    - "Tr\u1EE9ng cu\u1ED9n"
    - "D\u01B0a leo"
    - "N\u1EA5m shiitake"
    - "Ch\u1EA3 c\xE1 kamaboko"
    - "Rong bi\u1EC3n"
    allergensVi:
    - "Tr\u1EE9ng"
    - "C\xE1 (ch\u1EA3 c\xE1)"
    - "\u0110\u1EADu n\xE0nh"
    - "L\xFAa m\xEC"
    eatingTipVi: "Mi\u1EBFng to, c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\u1EAFn l\xE0m hai l\u1EA7n. Ch\u1EA5m
      n\u01B0\u1EDBc t\u01B0\u01A1ng \xEDt."
