      ngh\u0129a l\xE0 'r\u1EA3i'). V\xE0o ng\xE0y Hinamatsuri (3/3), nhi\u1EC1u
      gia \u0111\xECnh Nh\u1EADt \u0103n chirashi zushi. K\xE8m s\xFAp miso."
    descriptionEn: Vinegared rice topped with assorted seafood, egg and vegetables
      ('chirashi' means 'scattered'). Many families eat it on Hinamatsuri (March
      3). Comes with miso soup.
    ingredientsVi:
