  - id: hibari_set
    categoryId: donburi
    nameJa: "\u3072\u3070\u308A\u7279\u9078\u306B\u304E\u308A"
    reading: "\u3072\u3070\u308A\u3068\u304F\u305B\u3093\u306B\u304E\u308A"
    romaji: Hibari tokusen nigiri
    nameVi: "Set nigiri \u0111\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t c\u1EE7a Hibari"
    nameEn: Hibari premium nigiri set
    priceYen: 1180
    descriptionJa: "\u3072\u3070\u308A\u7279\u9078\u306B\u304E\u308A\u306F\u3001\u4ECA\u65E5\u3044\u3061\u3070\u3093\u3088\u3044\u9B5A\u306E\u3059\u3057\u30BB\u30C3\u30C8\u3067\u3059\u3002"
    descriptionVi: "Set 8 mi\u1EBFng nigiri do \u0111\u1EA7u b\u1EBFp ch\u1ECDn theo
      c\xE1 t\u01B0\u01A1i nh\u1EA5t trong ng\xE0y, k\xE8m tr\u1EE9ng cu\u1ED9n v\xE0
      s\xFAp miso. Qu\xE1n l\xE0m theo phong c\xE1ch 'Edomae' (\u6C5F\u6238\u524D)
      t\u1EEB v\xF9ng v\u1ECBnh Tokyo x\u01B0a: c\xE1 \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u01B0\u1EDBp,
      \u1EE7 ho\u1EB7c n\u1EA5u nh\u1EB9 \u0111\u1EC3 l\u1EA5y v\u1ECB t\u1ED1t nh\u1EA5t."
    descriptionEn: 'An 8-piece nigiri set chosen by the chef from the day''s freshest
      fish, with tamago and miso soup. Prepared in the ''Edomae'' style from old
      Tokyo Bay: fish is marinated, aged or lightly cooked to bring out flavor.'
    ingredientsVi:
    - "C\u01A1m sushi"
    - "C\xE1 theo m\xF9a (do \u0111\u1EA7u b\u1EBFp ch\u1ECDn)"
    - "Tr\u1EE9ng cu\u1ED9n"
    - "S\xFAp miso"
    allergensVi:
    - "C\xE1"
    - "Tr\u1EE9ng"
    - "\u0110\u1EADu n\xE0nh"
    - "C\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\xF3 \u0111\u1ED9ng v\u1EADt gi\xE1p x\xE1c v\xE0 th\xE2n
      m\u1EC1m \u2014 h\xE3y h\u1ECFi nh\xE2n vi\xEAn"
    eatingTipVi: "\u0102n t\u1EEB mi\u1EBFng nh\u1EA1t v\u1ECB (c\xE1 tr\u1EAFng)
      \u0111\u1EBFn \u0111\u1EADm v\u1ECB (l\u01B0\u01A1n, c\xE1 ng\u1EEB b\xE9o),
      gi\u1EEFa c\xE1c mi\u1EBFng \u0103n m\u1ED9t l\xE1t g\u1EEBng ng\xE2m (gari)."
    isSpecialty: 1
    specialtyNoteVi: "M\xF3n \u0111\u1EB7c tr\u01B0ng c\u1EE7a qu\xE1n. 'Shun' (\u65EC)
