    - "C\xE1 (dashi)"
    - "\u0110\u1ED9ng v\u1EADt gi\xE1p x\xE1c (t\xF4m)"
    - "H\u1EA1t ng\xE2n h\u1EA1nh (c\xF3 th\u1EC3 c\xF3)"
    eatingTipVi: "D\xF9ng th\xECa nh\u1ECF \u0111i k\xE8m. \u0110\xE2y l\xE0 m\xF3n
